Dz-2RQXWVfUaZGc0xh_XktQcAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAAAAgEMAAAAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAADcCd3iwAAAA==','Recycle','Merril','2026-07-03 14:19:18','Task Recycled by Merril',NULL),(720,'AQMkADI1ZDk4YzIzLTU3NDUtNDFhMy1hMDJmLTkxYzY5NTY5ZDFiMwBGAAADz-2RQXWVfUaZGc0xh_XktQcAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAAAAgEMAAAAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAADcCd3cwAAAA==','Delegation','Merril','2026-07-03 14:21:00','Task Delegated by Merril',NULL),(721,'AQMkADI1ZDk4YzIzLTU3NDUtNDFhMy1hMDJmLTkxYzY5NTY5ZDFiMwBGAAADz-2RQXWVfUaZGc0xh_XktQcAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAAAAgEMAAAAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAADcCd3cgAAAA==','Delegation','Merril','2026-07-03 14:21:38','Task Delegated by Merril',NULL),(722,'AQMkADI1ZDk4YzIzLTU3NDUtNDFhMy1hMDJmLTkxYzY5NTY5ZDFiMwBGAAADz-2RQXWVfUaZGc0xh_XktQcAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAAAAgEMAAAAthJtB2yJtk_Dl2mFxk9sWAADcCd3fQAAAA==','REPLY_SENT','Gail','2026-07-03 14:23:13','Feedback to Sanlam | CC:  | BCC: \n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Good day Unity,</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Please see below request/email from employer below.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Further to our telephone conversation this morning regarding the pension\r\nbenefit payable to Vuyile Gqasana, I would like to submit the following\r\nrequest.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">After submitting the necessary forms to Sanlam for the payment of the\r\nabove member’s pension benefit, we were informed that Vuyile Gqasana’s benefit\r\ncannot be paid because he does not have a tax number registered with SARS.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">I would like to explain the circumstances, as he is not in a position to\r\nobtain a SARS tax number on his own, while Sanlam maintains that, due to\r\nlegislation, payment cannot be made without one.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Vuyile Gqasana is a 60-year-old Xhosa-speaking man who is illiterate and\r\ncan barely write his surname. It is virtually impossible for him to obtain a\r\nSARS tax number independently before applying for his benefit. He lives\r\napproximately 300 km (a three-hour drive) from the nearest SARS office in Port\r\nElizabeth. In addition, he is not proficient in English or Afrikaans and\r\ntherefore cannot read or understand the information provided. He is also not\r\ncomputer literate and cannot make use of the online options available.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">My question is: what is he expected to do in these circumstances? Sanlam\r\nis refusing to pay his benefit solely because legislation requires him to have\r\na tax number—something he has never needed throughout his working life, given\r\nthat he has earned a minimum wage for many years. Furthermore, as his employer,\r\nwe were required to provide him with pension benefits, yet all the\r\nadministrative requirements now being imposed seem unreasonable considering his\r\ncircumstances.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">I would suggest that Sanlam assist him directly in obtaining a tax\r\nnumber, particularly since the benefit is owed to him. We are located on a\r\nremote farm in the Eastern Cape, where people live far from the conveniences\r\nand services available in cities. Unfortunately, no one seems to understand the\r\nchallenges faced by people in these rural areas.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Ultimately, we may be forced to seek legal assistance, at Sanlam’s\r\nexpense, to secure the payment of his benefit. I therefore request that Sanlam\r\ntake steps to assist its clients in situations such as this.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Thank you in advance for allowing me, as his employer, to submit this\r\nrequest on behalf of Vuyile Gqasana and to explain his circumstances.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\r\ncolor:#333333;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Kind regards,</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;;color:#333333;m