ans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">With the introduction of the 2 Pot legislation on 01/09/24, the exit process has become more complicated. </span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Thanks for notifying us of the <b>resignation</b> for above member.</span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><a name=\"_Hlk219900419\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk219900072\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">There are 2 documents that must now be completed:</span></span></a></span></span></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">the new out-of-service form and </span></span></span></span></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">a basic form which is also signed by the member. </span></span></span></span></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Both documents must be sent to </span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</span></b></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> by indicating fund code and initials and surname in the Subject Line. </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;(Sanlam no longer accepts old forms). <b>Please refer to the basic form to see the amount which can be taken in cash if any, and the amount which must be preserved.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly note that the basic withdrawal form/consent form is password protected in terms of the POPI Act. Kindly use the password to open the document.</span></b></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></span></span></span></p><ol start=\"3\" type=\"a\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The following documents must also be submitted with the claim forms:</span></span></span></span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1)Identity document</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2)Bank Statement in member’s own name</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3)SARS Notice of registration which provides the member’s full name</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; and surname, identity number and tax number.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please send the completed forms indicating the <b>last contribution date of 31/5/2026</b> to </span></span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</span></b></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></a><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly note that if a member was ill before leaving service then they may qualify for disability benefits if provided by the rules of the Fund. Please therefore always notify us immediately if the member was sick when notifying us of members who leave your service.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">If a MEMBER ceases to be employed by a PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER and, immediately afterwards starts working for another PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER <b>he will remain a MEMBER of the FUND. </b>In such event the MEMBER’S <b>membership will be deemed not to have ceased </b>and he will remain entitled to such benefits and on such conditions as provided for in the RULES. Claims submitted will not be processed by the Fund’s back office if a member immediately starts working for another employer that contributes to the same fund, as the fund sees this as an active member and therefore any new contributions will be added to the existing member record. Please mark the claim form accordingly in such events.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><a name=\"_Hlk176529369\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please inform the member to consult with their Financial Advisor for completion of options on the form if needed.</span></a></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: It is important to submit claim forms when members leave your service, so that we can arrange for timeous payment.</span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please</span></i></b><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> be advised, due to the complexities of claim payments post 1 September 2024 – the turnaround time for all payments has been extended from 10 business days to 30 business days, providing all outstanding documentation has been received. </span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></i></b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><